        "key": "description",
        "label": "Description",
        "order": 0,
        "type": "text",
        "readable": "Portion of an employee’s salary that the employer deducts and remits directly to the government as advance payment of the employee’s income tax.\nThis ensures taxes are paid gradually each pay period, reducing the employee’s year-end tax burden and keeping the employer compliant with the Bureau of Internal Revenue regulations in the Philippines.",
